%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OperationsAdmin as Workshop Operations Administrator
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as BookingService
    participant Records as BookingRepository
    participant Dep as AuthService
    OperationsAdmin->>UI: Record customer contact, vehicle, and service request
    UI->>Service: Submit full offline service registration request
    Service->>Records: Check required service details without requiring NIK
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate kontak dan kendaraan minimum tercatat
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: findOrCreateDraftAccount(contact)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Create or link a draft account and save the service history
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Continue to inspection, estimate, and payment
        UI-->>OperationsAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Keep the draft account unverified until registration
        UI-->>OperationsAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
    opt Customer participates in this use case
        Customer->>UI: Provide contact and vehicle details or make payment
        UI->>Service: Submit the role-specific response
        Service->>Records: Save the additional case action
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the additional action
        Service-->>Customer: Return the recorded outcome
    end
